<p>Sarah		unloading   corn	     13,476     U.S.</p>
<p>				     sorghum	  26,186</p>
<p>				     soya	     23,700</p>
<p>Kapitan Baglay   unloading   fish meal	 5,000     Peru</p>
<p>Valday	     unloading   sunflower meal  2,500     Europe</p>
